ke ordering coffee a treat! I hate that they don't have a tip line on their credit/debit card receipts because I often forget to carry cash to tip and feel like an asshole. I definitely recommend this location for your afternoon pick-me-up!"},{"business_id":"yMLdnKqOErWTvaE8djPzDA","review_id":"NQoRmeZI2ojDP9anYXsBhw","date":"2017-12-10T18:30:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9203545451164246,"text_excerpt":"Hands down one of my favorite Starbucks locations. Staff is always friendly and work quickly to get your order. It's usually busy during the morning so if you're in a hurry, place a mobile order from the app!"},{"business_id":"yMLdnKqOErWTvaE8djPzDA","review_id":"43U1Gxe3mwSqq0ttgGU2Ng","date":"2013-10-02T00:52:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9072889089584351,"text_excerpt":"Staff was very genuinely friendly and accommodating. I ordered a lime refresher and didn't like it so a staff member happily made me a very berry hibiscus one instead. This is also a pretty large Starbucks. The only thing I didn't like were the bench seating directly in front of the registers. They were awkward and uncomfortable and directly in front of you are people ordering their drinks. Other than that this place is great."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yMLdnKqOErWTvaE8djPzDA","photo_id":"SNRJc4ga49zFMPX9ftBg2g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SNRJc4ga49zFMPX9ftBg2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.900533139705658},{"business_id":"yMLdnKqOErWTvaE8djPzDA","photo_id":"oHo01oIz--dCsXJqQTYoKA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/oHo01oIz--dCsXJqQTYoKA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9005330801010132}]},"notebook_case":null}
